{"key": "48ce1767e37661eaea749991b9876785", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "response": {"content": [{"text": "Sim, o Link de Pagamento aceita boleto: a página do produto diz que você pode deixar o comprador escolher entre débito, crédito, Pix, Wallet e boleto [5][7]. Já a página de dúvidas lista cartão de crédito, débito, QR Code e Pix como formas aceitas, sem citar boleto [2]. Como a página do produto traz o boleto, a confirmação vale pelas passagens [5][7].\n\nQuanto ao prazo de validade de cada link, nenhuma passagem traz esse dado. Só aparece uma regra diferente: o lojista pode ficar até 4 meses sem transacionar, e depois disso o Link de Pagamento é desabilitado e exige novas aprovações [3].\n\nMISSING: prazo de validade de cada link de pagamento", "type": "text"}], "id": "msg_011CgkbRDYhZ3QjXk39L9yLt", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "role": "assistant", "stop_reason": "end_turn", "type": "message", "usage": {"cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0}, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 2739, "inference_geo": "global", "input_tokens": 3929, "output_tokens": 273, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 0}, "service_tier": "standard", "speed": "standard"}}, "role": "agent", "scope": "q-partial-03#0"}
{"key": "49f1bb159802da6469e62b388cc786ce", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "response": {"content": [{"text": "There is no single exact monthly fee for the Get Smart in the sources, and none of them gives battery life in hours.\n\n**Monthly fee**\n- The Get Smart page lists rental that depends on sales volume. It is R$50,00 of rental for sales from R$10 mil/month and R$10,00 for sales from R$30 mil/month. From R$60 mil/month the Get Smart is free [7].\n- The sources say you pay Getnet rental and administrative fees. App subscriptions are charged by the app developers, and you negotiate them directly with those companies [2].\n- A 2025 page says the machine is free with sales from R$60.000 [8]. A 2026 page lists different thresholds, with Get Clássica or Get Smart free above R$40 mil/month [9]. Because the pages disagree, check the current offer.\n\n**Battery**\n- The sources give care tips only. Charge it whenever possible, ideally for at least 3 hours straight, and recharge when it reaches 20% instead of waiting for it to run out [1]. This is charging advice, not battery life.\n\nMISSING: battery life in hours; a single fixed monthly fee for the Get Smart", "type": "text"}], "id": "msg_011CgkbR91LfAYFaBhLkZqjp", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "role": "assistant", "stop_reason": "end_turn", "type": "message", "usage": {"cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 2129}, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 2129, "cache_read_input_tokens": 5524, "inference_geo": "global", "input_tokens": 2, "output_tokens": 379, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 0}, "service_tier": "standard", "speed": "standard"}}, "role": "agent", "scope": "q-partial-02#0"}
{"key": "f8e2ef2c44c87f1c5419c479900134f9", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "response": {"content": [{"caller": {"type": "direct"}, "id": "toolu_0145Rx6BU7v76d9MDaKDGXr6", "input": {"query": "A Get Clássica imprime comprovante e aceita pagamento por aproximação com relógio (NFC/wearable)?"}, "name": "faq_agent", "type": "tool_use"}], "id": "msg_011CgkbRHovPvpmFu1MAHHsx", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "role": "assistant", "stop_reason": "tool_use", "type": "message", "usage": {"cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 1009}, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 1009, "cache_read_input_tokens": 2763, "inference_geo": "global", "input_tokens": 4, "output_tokens": 89, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 0}, "service_tier": "standard", "speed": "standard"}}, "role": "supervisor", "scope": "q-partial-05#0"}
{"key": "1a5a5c0b6caf509c16a8efc0c2d2a9d7", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "response": {"content": [{"text": "As fontes não trazem o percentual da taxa da Antecipação Automática, nem um valor específico para o seu CNPJ.\n\nO que elas dizem:\n- A Antecipação Automática é uma condição para obter a isenção em clientes que optam pelo plano de recebimento \"Receba Conforme suas Vendas\" [1].\n- Ela passa por um processo de aprovação de crédito, e a Getnet avalia individualmente cada contrato para conceder (ou não) o produto [1].\n- A página de taxas informa que as taxas do crédito parcelado \"não incluem a taxa de Antecipação de vendas, se contratada\" [6]. Isso indica que essa taxa é cobrada à parte, sem trazer o valor.\n- Há outras formas de antecipar: a Antecipação Eventual, pela Central de Atendimento Getnet, e a Antecipação pelo POS, feita no próprio equipamento [2].\n\nComo a condição é avaliada contrato aently contrato [1], o valor para o seu CNPJ não está nas fontes. Se quiser, posso encaminhar o caso a um atendente humano, que abre um protocolo e responde nesta mesma conversa [policy:capabilities].\n\nMISSING: percentual da taxa da Antecipação Automática e valor específico para o CNPJ do cliente", "type": "text"}], "id": "msg_011CgkbRBBp71worMUd21M8C", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "role": "assistant", "stop_reason": "end_turn", "type": "message", "usage": {"cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 2739}, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 2739, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "inference_geo": "global", "input_tokens": 4035, "output_tokens": 446, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 0}, "service_tier": "standard", "speed": "standard"}}, "role": "agent", "scope": "q-partial-01#0"}
{"key": "69e8dcd7ade7cc15026afdfe7bf819b9", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "response": {"content": [{"text": "Yes, the buyer pays interest on the crediário, and it depends on the card issuer: installments go up to 48x, and the maximum term and interest rate vary by issuer [1][7]. The buyer can see the interest through a simulation on the card machine (credit > crediário), and can print the simulation receipt if the machine has paper [2].\n\nOn timing for you as the merchant, crediário sales are paid in up to 2 business days after the transaction is captured, in a single payment regardless of the number of installments [4]. The simulation is for reference only and is subject to credit analysis, so the card issuer approves the transaction at the time of contracting [2].\n\nThe sources do not give a specific approval time (for example, in seconds or minutes) for the crediário.\n\nMISSING: crediário approval time", "type": "text"}], "id": "msg_011CgkbRGjC26rkupvmHfbj3", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "role": "assistant", "stop_reason": "end_turn", "type": "message", "usage": {"cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 2738}, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 2738, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "inference_geo": "global", "input_tokens": 3493, "output_tokens": 251, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 0}, "service_tier": "standard", "speed": "standard"}}, "role": "agent", "scope": "q-partial-04#0"}
{"key": "5d3bcfc871efa1670c0b9982b71b49b8", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "response": {"content": [{"caller": {"type": "direct"}, "id": "toolu_01866FqNzofs6ad83qAAqmPH", "input": {"query": "Get Clássica"}, "name": "search", "type": "tool_use"}], "id": "msg_011CgkbRSyLdpeftuD3NtJ24", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "role": "assistant", "stop_reason": "tool_use", "type": "message", "usage": {"cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 2443}, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 2443, "cache_read_input_tokens": 3127, "inference_geo": "global", "input_tokens": 4, "output_tokens": 50, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 0}, "service_tier": "standard", "speed": "standard"}}, "role": "agent", "scope": "q-partial-05#0"}
{"key": "78eb9a3f864291998a9ee466dda929a2", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "response": {"content": [{"text": "Sim, o Link de Pagamento aceita boleto. A página do produto diz que o comprador pode escolher entre débito, crédito, Pix, Wallet e boleto [prod-link-de-pagamento-02][prod-link-de-pagamento-01]. A página de dúvidas lista só cartão de crédito, débito, QR Code e Pix, sem citar boleto [sup-link-de-pagamento-10].\n\nNão encontrei o prazo de validade de cada link nas fontes. Só aparece uma regra de inatividade: o lojista pode ficar até 4 meses sem transacionar. Depois disso, o Link de Pagamento é desabilitado e exige novas aprovações [sup-duvidas-50].\n\nSe quiser, posso encaminhar você a um atendente humano para confirmar o prazo de validade.", "type": "text"}], "id": "msg_011CgkbRPbSU4TUFoDsuwJcK", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "role": "assistant", "stop_reason": "end_turn", "type": "message", "usage": {"cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 708}, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 708, "cache_read_input_tokens": 3770, "inference_geo": "global", "input_tokens": 2, "output_tokens": 280, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 0}, "service_tier": "standard", "speed": "standard"}}, "role": "supervisor", "scope": "q-partial-03#0"}
{"key": "4b7ddb1d61331315ea20ca2ef2a64098", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "response": {"content": [{"text": "There is no single exact monthly fee for the Get Smart. The rental depends on your sales volume, and the sources don't give battery life in hours.\n\n**Monthly fee**\n- The rental is R$50,00 for sales from R$10 mil/month and R$10,00 for sales from R$30 mil/month. From R$60 mil/month the Get Smart is free [prod-get-smart-02].\n- You pay Getnet rental and administrative fees. App subscriptions are charged by the app developers, and you negotiate those directly with them [sup-get-smart-12].\n- The sources disagree on the free threshold. A 2025 page says the machine is free with sales from R$60.000 [prod-get-smart-01]. A 2026 page says Get Clássica or Get Smart is free above R$40 mil/month [prod-todas-maquininhas-02]. Check the current offer.\n\n**Battery**\n- The sources only give care tips. Charge it whenever possible, ideally for at least 3 hours straight, and recharge at 20% instead of waiting for it to run out [sup-get-smart-03]. This is charging advice, not battery life in hours.\n\nI can pass your case to a human agent if you want the battery figure confirmed.", "type": "text"}], "id": "msg_011CgkbRPsoDVqZ7sqv2Tf1E", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "role": "assistant", "stop_reason": "end_turn", "type": "message", "usage": {"cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 763}, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 763, "cache_read_input_tokens": 3663, "inference_geo": "global", "input_tokens": 2, "output_tokens": 397, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 0}, "service_tier": "standard", "speed": "standard"}}, "role": "supervisor", "scope": "q-partial-02#0"}
{"key": "adb18c41afd5188174d9093670ca926e", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "response": {"content": [{"text": "Yes, the buyer pays interest on the crediário. The rate depends on the card issuer. Installments go up to 48x, and the maximum term and rate vary by issuer [prod-crediario-02][prod-crediario-03]. The buyer can see the interest by running a simulation on the card machine (credit > crediário). They can print the simulation receipt if the machine has paper [sup-crediario-03].\n\nOn approval, the simulation is for reference only and is subject to credit analysis. The card issuer approves the transaction when the buyer contracts it [sup-crediario-03].\n\nFor you as the merchant, crediário sales are paid within 2 business days of capture, in a single payment regardless of the number of installments [sup-duvidas-37].\n\nThe sources don't give a specific approval time, such as seconds or minutes. I can pass this to a human agent if you'd like.", "type": "text"}], "id": "msg_011CgkbRTpghgKXm31ZNJHLw", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "role": "assistant", "stop_reason": "end_turn", "type": "message", "usage": {"cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 608}, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 608, "cache_read_input_tokens": 3663, "inference_geo": "global", "input_tokens": 2, "output_tokens": 279, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 0}, "service_tier": "standard", "speed": "standard"}}, "role": "supervisor", "scope": "q-partial-04#0"}
